In this folder, I will create a more complete specification for the library manager design used to add a book to the shelf.

This will involve setting up the following participants:

- BookName
    - Attribute: Type (String)
    - Attribute: Length (Number)
    - Domain: Contains Letters
- FirstLetterOfBookName
    - Attribute: Type (String)
    - Domain: Single Letter
- Book
    - Attribute: Type (String)
    - Domain: Contains Object with Book Name in Name Key
- Shelf
    - Attribute: Type (String)
    - Domain: Object with Books sorted using FirstLetterOfBookName

Behavior:
- Initialize World
    - Creates Shelf participant
- GetBookName
    - Accepts Book Name from user
    - Creates BookName participant
- CreateBook
    - Creates Book Using Name
    - Creates Book participant
- GetFirstLetterOfBookName
    - Gets First Letter of Book Name
    - Creates FirstLetterOfBookName participant
    - Removes BookName from world state
- AddBookToShelf
    - Adds Book To Shelf
    - Updates shelf in world state
    - Removes book from world state
